==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Divine Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**10 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
In this stage the enemies push very hard, combining a cyclone with an Angelic Sleipnir, you have to use [[Knockback]] or other crowd control methods. Talented [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]], [[Stilts Cat (Rare Cat)|Acrobat]], [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet Cat]], and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] are all useful units to bring. You should also bring some [[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|snipers]] to target the Angelic Sleipnir (surge talent Acrobat Cats could also be used to target the Sleipnir). Even though it is a cyclone stage [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can still be useful as there are still a lot of strong peons.

